msgctxt "about_body_1"
msgid ""
"At Policrafters, we take pride in delivering solutions that are not only innovative but also highly customizable to meet the unique needs of each client. Our commitment to excellence is reflected in"
" every project we undertake, from concept to completion. A distinguished name in Interior Design and Architecture Solutions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "about_body_2"
msgid ""
"Crafted in the United States using premium-quality materials and cutting-edge technology, our products are a testament to the expertise and dedication of our seasoned team. Our workforce brings a "
"wealth of experience to the table, enabling us to design, manufacture, and install bespoke solutions across South Florida and beyond. Whether you're in the market for intricate glasswork, aluminum, "
"other metals, or wood craftsmanship, Policrafters is equipped to bring your vision to life."
msgstr ""

